{% assign human = site.data.research_figures.human_observations %}
{% assign aggregate = human.aggregate %}
{% assign tester = human.tester6 %}
{% assign ai_total = aggregate.ai_total %}
{% capture selection_aria %}{% for selection in aggregate.selections %}{{ selection.label }} {{ selection.count }}회{% unless forloop.last %}, {% endunless %}{% endfor %}{% endcapture %}
<figure class="research-figure" aria-labelledby="selection-title">
  <p class="figure-eyebrow">FIGURE 04A · {{ aggregate.measured_on }} 집계</p>
  <h3 class="figure-title" id="selection-title">{{ aggregate.sessions }}판에서 기록된 규칙 선택 {{ aggregate.denominator }}회</h3>
  <div class="selection-grid" role="img" aria-label="{{ selection_aria }}">
    {% for selection in aggregate.selections %}
      {% for i in (1..selection.count) %}<span class="selection-tile{% if selection.id == 'recommendation' %} selection-tile--recommended{% elsif selection.id == 'custom' %} selection-tile--custom{% endif %}" title="{{ selection.label }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endfor %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="figure-legend">
    {% for selection in aggregate.selections %}<span><i class="selection-tile{% if selection.id == 'recommendation' %} selection-tile--recommended{% elsif selection.id == 'custom' %} selection-tile--custom{% endif %}"></i>{{ selection.label }} {{ selection.count }}회</span>{% endfor %}
  </p>
  <p class="figure-caution">확정·유력 사람 세션 {{ aggregate.sessions }}판의 탐색적 집계입니다. 관찰 기간의 기구 버전이 섞였고, 선택은 무작위 배정이 아닙니다.</p>
  <p class="figure-source"><a href="{{ '/experiments/human-observations/' | relative_url }}#{{ aggregate.source_anchor }}">출처: Exp 2 · 집계 결과</a></p>
  <figcaption><strong>그림 4A · {{ aggregate.measured_on }}.</strong> AI 계열 선택 {{ ai_total }}회는 {{ aggregate.selections[0].label }} {{ aggregate.selections[0].count }}회와 {{ aggregate.selections[1].label }} {{ aggregate.selections[1].count }}회를 합친 값입니다. {{ aggregate.selections[2].label }}은 {{ aggregate.selections[2].count }}회였습니다.</figcaption>
</figure>

